00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:38.030
longevity. Regenerative braking shifts wear away from the friction parts that dominate

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:43.170
maintenance budgets on internal combustion cars. Owner's could skip multiple brake jobs

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:48.250
over a vehicle's life. That lowers the effective cost per mile with no change in purchase

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:54.050
