00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:04.050
stress elsewhere. Tires, suspension bushings, and the battery thermal loop take more of

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:09.990
the load. Tesla's structural battery pack and 4680 cell architecture were designed

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:14.870
partly to manage those loads at scale. The public data set still looks thin beyond

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:16.230
